### RAG 检索
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "conversationId": 1,
  "question": "如何让知识检索更可信？",
  "knowledgeBaseIds": []
}

### 流式 RAG 检索（delta / citations / done，失败为 error 后关闭）
# 所有 data 使用 CommonResult；done.data 为完整答案与引用，需替换暂定增量内容。
# knowledgeBaseIds 更新本会话后续提问范围；空列表表示全部有权知识库，不传沿用会话当前范围。
# error 后保留原问题，使用相同 conversationId 和 question 可重试。
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/rag/ask-stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "conversationId": 1,
  "question": "如何让知识检索更可信？",
  "knowledgeBaseIds": []
}

### 所选上下文RAG：不补充自动检索；不传selectedChunkIds沿用，空数组清空
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"conversationId":1,"question":"这些材料的结论是什么？","selectedChunkIds":[1,2],"modelId":1}

### 清空所选上下文，恢复自动检索
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"conversationId":1,"question":"继续查找证据","selectedChunkIds":[]}
